Participation Schedule for Two Receipts
Incorporate policy "money-rounding@1".
Aggregate Receipts are First Receipt plus Second Receipt.
Unrounded Participation is 50% of Aggregate Receipts.
Participation is round_usd(Unrounded Participation, USD 0.01, "half_even").
Report "participation": Participation.

Bindings:
  Schedule TwoReceiptParticipation.
  Using language "spl/0.1-draft" core "spl-core/0.1-draft" schema "spl-data/0.1-draft".
  input first_receipt: Money<USD>;
  input second_receipt: Money<USD>;
  Bind "First Receipt" to first_receipt.
  Bind "Second Receipt" to second_receipt.
  Bind "Aggregate Receipts" to aggregate_receipts.
  Bind "Unrounded Participation" to unrounded_participation.
  Bind "Participation" to participation.
